'''Enigma's Crib''' is a sub-location of the {{zone|Wyld Woods}} in the [[Rift Dimension]].

== Purpose ==
=== Enigma ===
{{Main|Enigma}}
[[Enigma]] is the sole [[NPC]] located in '''Enigma's Crib'''. Whenever the player turns their back to them or directs their line of vision in a direction other than [[Enigma]], they will change location quickly. Every {{Green|4}} [[Enigma Soul]]s the player finds, they can exchange them with [[Enigma]] for a price in order to gain a small but permanent stat bonus.

=== Orbs ===
Unlike the orbs that can be picked up around the [[Rift]] to grant [[Rift Time]] and [[Motes]], the orbs in '''Enigma's Crib''' grant only {{Motes|10}} as opposed to the {{Pink|25}} granted by ordinary orbs. Additionally, the distance requirement for orbs to spawn is removed, and multiple can spawn at the same time in a small radius.

